{"meta":{"id":"array-list","category":"it/syntax/java/object","title":"배열 · List · Java","subtitle":"(JAVA)","summary":"고정 길이 배열과 ArrayList, List.of 불변 리스트, stream map/filter","tags":["java","f-array"],"color":"emerald","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-emerald","source":"syntax","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-emerald-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-emerald-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-emerald-50 text-emerald-700 border border-emerald-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></span>JAVA</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">배열 · List · Java</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-emerald-50/70 border border-emerald-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-emerald-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> 고정 길이 배열과 ArrayList, List.of 불변 리스트, stream map/filter</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">배열 (고정 길이)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">int[] nums = {1, 2, 3};\r\nString[] names = new String[3];     // 길이 고정, 기본값 null\r\nnums.length;                        // 3\r\nArrays.sort(nums);</pre></div></div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">List (가변 길이)</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">java</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">List&lt;String&gt; list = new ArrayList&lt;&gt;();\r\nlist.add(&quot;kim&quot;);\r\nlist.get(0);\r\nlist.size();\r\n\r\nList&lt;Integer&gt; fixed = List.of(1, 2, 3);      // 불변 (readonly)\r\n\r\nList&lt;Integer&gt; doubled = fixed.stream()       // map / filter\r\n    .map(n -&gt; n * 2)\r\n    .filter(n -&gt; n &gt; 2)\r\n    .toList();</pre></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> TypeScript › 배열 — TS 배열은 Java 의 List 처럼 길이가 자유로움</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/java/object/array-list","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"java","title":"JAVA","path":"it/syntax/java"},{"id":"object","title":"객체 · 컬렉션","path":"it/syntax/java/object"}],"hasImage":false}